Spec: Public connection status value

Purpose:
  Read a bounded immutable connection status without treating transport selection as business delivery.

Owns:
  ./ConnectionStatus.java

Must:
  Restrict UTC years to 0001 through 9999 and reject leap seconds or 24-hour rollover normalization.
  Match the public status DTO with exact fields, canonical UUIDs, owner/device/service references, uint64 decimal strings and UTC millisecond timestamps.
  Require counters only on the immutable selected path and report business path only after positive payload bytes.
  Reject impossible pending/ready/terminal combinations, unknown fields, malformed counters and reflected exception objects.
  Keep all exposed values immutable and return a fresh map when a wire object is requested.
